Bluetooth: MGMT: Fix UAF on mgmt_remove_adv_monitor_complete

jira KERNEL-1078
cve CVE-2025-39981
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.126.1.el8_10
commit-author Luiz Augusto von Dentz <luiz.von.dentz@intel.com>
commit e6ed54e86aae9e4f7286ce8d5c73780f91b48d1c
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.126.1.el8_10/e6ed54e8.failed

This reworks MGMT_OP_REMOVE_ADV_MONITOR to not use mgmt_pending_add to
avoid crashes like bellow:

